@* MudBlazor's popover/dialog/snackbar/theme providers, scoped per interactive page rather than the
   shared MainLayout. App.razor deliberately has no ambient @rendermode on <Routes /> (Login.razor needs
   to stay static SSR so SignInManager can write the auth cookie), so this app uses PER-PAGE
   interactivity instead of one global interactive boundary. MudBlazor requires these providers to
   render within that SAME per-page boundary - a copy sitting in the (non-interactive-by-default)
   MainLayout doesn't count, and popovers/snackbars/dialogs silently do nothing without it.
   Include <MudProviders /> once at the top of every page that declares @rendermode InteractiveServer
   and uses any of Snackbar/Dialog/popover-based components (MudSelect, MudMenu, MudDatePicker, ...). *@
<MudThemeProvider Theme="TradingTools.Blazor.Theme.AppTheme.Theme" IsDarkMode="true" />
<MudPopoverProvider />
<MudDialogProvider />
<MudSnackbarProvider />
